      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/York%2C_Maine",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Old York Historical Society preserves a cluster of historic buildings in York Village, now museums that tell the town’s colonial story.",
